{"id":"凯瑟琳","type":"character","type_label":"人物","name":"凯瑟琳","aliases":["伊诺拉","罗莎莉亚","罗塞"],"warnings":["凯瑟琳旧名罗塞，曾是半神「伊诺拉」，与神战英雄迪为夫妻，勿与迪混淆"],"status":"approved","available_eras":["history","mainline","afterstory"],"static_profile":"凯瑟琳是「艾拉遗迹事件」的三名幸存者之一，曾获赐半神位格与神名「伊诺拉」，是神系内最早洞察「海拉」威胁的存在。为调查海拉，她舍弃半神躯壳，利用神力重构具备无限重置特性的凡人容器，潜入底层进行隐秘调查。","era_states":{"history":"凯瑟琳是「艾拉遗迹事件」的三名幸存者之一，在这次生还后获赐半神位格与神名「伊诺拉」。她是神系内最早洞察「海拉」威胁的存在。","mainline":"为详细调查海拉，凯瑟琳舍弃了半神的尊荣与躯壳，利用神力重构了一具具备无限重置特性的凡人容器，潜入底层进行漫长的隐秘调查。\n在化名为「罗塞」的轮回周期中，她熟识并选择了迪作为信任的锚点。她成为雷恩团队屡次险胜背后的操盘手。\n这种长期的潜伏与辅助直至「神战」爆发才浮出水面，她从幕后走向前台，恢复了作为核心战力的统御权。\n意志不可违逆，姿态潇洒；慵懒、玩味、意味深长；身在异国皇都，受当地尊敬，为异国付出过；准备返回故乡艾尔伯德；能远程感知菲亚“壳被敲碎”、某种联系重组。\n优雅、贵族腔调；慵懒而磁性的声音；冷若冰霜；成熟女性；伊诺拉=至高守护者（自称不确知）；不灭存在，肉体消亡后随机重塑新躯壳；每次重生记忆基本丢失，只保留身份认知、使命与能量本能；不能将情报落于文字/数据载体，只能靠直觉；罗塞=上一任身体；罗塞因触及海拉核心被杀害；与主神艾拉有盟约，失去神格仍须遵守；神性残留是能量传导'钥匙'；解读'罗塞守则'能量换取维持机制；与阿卡是旧识。\n兼具秘书的干练与慵懒的风情；女王般有条不紊地分发指令；关键时刻决然、有牺牲精神；菲尔处理私事时代管翡翠庄园；将发光立方体按入赛琳胸口、触发其完全天使化，自身耗尽生命力倒下。\n三人中最温柔、最爱人类的一个；（伊诺拉）最早发现异样、提前下来布局、主动抛弃神格；消散前把一部分「权限」移交赛琳。\n在帝国以「罗莎莉亚」之名担任逆光旅团新首领，干练、坚定、有战士气度；有一头烈火般耀眼的红发；失去一年前记忆，在帝国化名罗莎莉亚，任逆光旅团新首领；在帝国有了新的「使命」（逆光旅团）；左大腿内侧根部有红色痣（雷恩凭此认出她）。\n红发、紫罗兰眼眸、黑色制服，带浑然天成的威严；帝国篇失忆期用名「罗莎莉亚」，对过去无记忆；作战指挥果断决绝，焦虑时长发会凌乱；通讯频道中冷静指挥；作为逆光旅团首领与雷恩会师，制定「直捣黄龙」突袭帝都计划；指挥教堂之战；帝国事件后接受雷恩和迪邀请，定居艾尔伯德成为普通红发女孩。\n狡黠、笑眯眯、优雅；曾被人操纵记忆；在圣嘉尔别馆寻找「凯瑟琳」时期的记忆；提出让奥蕾拉「读取」雷恩身上艾莉丝痕迹的验证方案。\n声音轻柔、带安抚力；冷静、思路清晰，能当机立断下判断；曾是艾尔伯德的守护者；安抚离席赶回国的艾萨克；分析希塔恩抓艾拉是为了利用星神身份权限配合希尔造物；补充解释星神是能「开发」权限的生命体。\n艾拉派坚定支持者；与迪老板成婚。","afterstory":"战后，凯瑟琳与迪完成了世俗与灵魂层面的双重结合，育有一女柯洛琳。\n如今，她作为神匠工会会长，掌控着工房都市的技术命脉，是连接神权与工匠阶层的枢纽。"},"facts":[{"fact_id":"fact_01115","statement":"凯瑟琳是「艾拉遗迹事件」的三名幸存者之一，获赐半神位格与神名「伊诺拉」。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"于「艾拉遗迹事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目77（次要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01116","statement":"凯瑟琳是神系内最早洞察「海拉」威胁的存在。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"history","era_label":"历史","time":"自「主线开始前的历史截止点」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目77（次要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01117","statement":"凯瑟琳为调查海拉，舍弃半神躯壳，利用神力重构具备无限重置特性的凡人容器，潜入底层进行隐秘调查。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目77（次要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01118","statement":"凯瑟琳在化名「罗塞」的轮回周期中，熟识并选择了迪作为信任的锚点。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目77（次要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01119","statement":"凯瑟琳是雷恩团队屡次险胜背后的操盘手，直至「神战」爆发才从幕后走向前台。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「星神之塔事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目77（次要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01120","statement":"「神战」后，凯瑟琳与迪完成世俗与灵魂层面的双重结合，育有一女柯洛琳。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「神战结束第八年柯洛琳出生」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目77（次要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01121","statement":"凯瑟琳现任神匠工会会长，掌控工房都市技术命脉，连接神权与工匠阶层。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「当前后日谈最新时间点」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目77（次要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_01122","statement":"身在异国皇都，被当地老者尊称“凯瑟琳大人”，感谢她对异国的付出","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第33章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01123","statement":"意志不可违逆，姿态潇洒","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第33章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01124","statement":"准备返回故乡艾尔伯德","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第33章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01125","statement":"能远程感知到菲亚“那层稚嫩的壳刚刚被男人敲碎了”、某种联系正在重组，称“进展那么快呀，小菲亚”","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第33章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01126","statement":"慵懒、玩味，嘴角挂着意味深长的笑","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第33章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01127","statement":"优雅、贵族腔调","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第42章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01128","statement":"声音慵懒而磁性","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第42章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01129","statement":"凯瑟琳平时神情冷峻。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第049"},{"fact_id":"fact_01130","statement":"是'不灭'的存在，每当肉体消亡便在世界上某处随机重塑新躯壳","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第43章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01131","statement":"每次重生记忆基本全部丢失，仅保留身份认知、使命（调查与守护）与能量运用本能","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第43章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01132","statement":"不能将情报落于文字/数据或实体载体，否则会被'某些存在'捕获，只能依赖直觉调查","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第43章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01133","statement":"罗塞是其上一任身体","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第43章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01134","statement":"上一任'罗塞'因触及海拉背后核心、可能拿到关键证据而被杀害","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第43章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01135","statement":"与主神艾拉有盟约，某些东西不能公开，即使失去神格仍须遵守","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第49章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01136","statement":"神性残留是能量传导的'钥匙'（负距离接触传导）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第44章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01137","statement":"解读咖啡厅二楼的'罗塞守则'为罗塞制定的能量换取维持机制","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第44章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01138","statement":"想确认'神降临的代价'，请雷恩在阿卡再临时通知她","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第49章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01139","statement":"与阿卡是旧识，称呼'好久不见了，阿卡'","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第50章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01140","statement":"凯瑟琳（罗塞）「不灭·随机重塑躯壳」的能力，是罗塞从半神变回人类暗中调查时向星神艾拉求取、艾拉同意并赐予的；她自身无法自加此能力，须更高位格的神授予。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"作者补充 2026-08-13"},{"fact_id":"fact_01141","statement":"红发","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位44"},{"fact_id":"fact_01142","statement":"拜托伊罗之家女孩以服务提振迪老板手下的士气","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第58章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01143","statement":"与阿卡一同调整诱捕装置的频率","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第59章"},{"fact_id":"fact_01144","statement":"伊诺拉是三位监督者中最温柔、最爱人类的一个","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位61"},{"fact_id":"fact_01145","statement":"伊诺拉最早发现异样、提前下来布局、主动抛弃神格","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位61"},{"fact_id":"fact_01146","statement":"凯瑟琳消散前把一部分「权限」移交赛琳","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位62"},{"fact_id":"fact_01147","statement":"咖啡厅二楼的补魔规则是伊诺拉留下的","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位68"},{"fact_id":"fact_01148","statement":"凯瑟琳失去一年前记忆，在帝国化名罗莎莉亚，任逆光旅团新首领","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位76"},{"fact_id":"fact_01149","statement":"凯瑟琳左大腿内侧根部有红色痣，雷恩凭此认出她","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位76"},{"fact_id":"fact_01150","statement":"凯瑟琳（罗莎莉亚）在帝国有了新的「使命」（逆光旅团）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位76"},{"fact_id":"fact_01151","statement":"凯瑟琳（伊诺拉）在帝国篇以「罗莎莉亚」之名失忆重生，雷恩凭红痣认出。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"作者补充 2026-08-13"},{"fact_id":"fact_01152","statement":"凯瑟琳（现用名罗莎莉亚）红色长发、穿黑色制服，紫罗兰眼眸带浑然天成的威严","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位81"},{"fact_id":"fact_01153","statement":"凯瑟琳表示「脑子里并没有关于你们的记忆」，失忆期用名罗莎莉亚，也懒得纠正叫错名的人","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位81"},{"fact_id":"fact_01154","statement":"凯瑟琳对雷恩说「看到你的第一眼，我的灵魂就在告诉我——把后背交给你绝对没问题」，相信直觉","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位81"},{"fact_id":"fact_01155","statement":"凯瑟琳判断帝国急于发动战争是筹备已到关键、急需大规模献祭","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位81"},{"fact_id":"fact_01156","statement":"凯瑟琳制定作战：利用各地骚乱掩护，精锐小队突入首都，艾琳娜开门、雷恩开路","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位81"},{"fact_id":"fact_01157","statement":"凯瑟琳焦虑时原本一丝不苟的长发也变得凌乱","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位83"},{"fact_id":"fact_01158","statement":"凯瑟琳下令带洛芬和重伤员撤退、让民众远离皇宫","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位84"},{"fact_id":"fact_01159","statement":"凯瑟琳（罗莎莉亚）帝国事件后接受邀请定居艾尔伯德，卸下首领重担，笑得比以前任何时候都灿烂","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位86"},{"fact_id":"fact_01160","statement":"笑眯眯、优雅，眼中带狡黠","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位96"},{"fact_id":"fact_01161","statement":"「她还叫凯瑟琳的时候，曾在圣嘉尔活跃很长一段时间」，前往圣嘉尔寻找记忆","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「林迪雅以神降协助追查艾莉丝」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位93"},{"fact_id":"fact_01162","statement":"提出让奥蕾拉身体如「读卡器」般读取雷恩体内信息","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「林迪雅以神降协助追查艾莉丝」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位96"},{"fact_id":"fact_01163","statement":"凯瑟琳是艾尔伯德的前守护者，以轻柔带安抚力的声音劝艾萨克不要过于担心","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位105"},{"fact_id":"fact_01164","statement":"凯瑟琳判断希塔恩抓走艾拉是为了利用其星神身份权限配合希尔造物","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位107"},{"fact_id":"fact_01165","statement":"凯瑟琳补充：星神是能够「开发」权限的生命体，己方拥有特别接口级别可暂时开启高于人类的权限","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位108"},{"fact_id":"fact_01166","statement":"作为艾拉派的坚定支持者，向苏醒的艾拉请求指示","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「艾拉获救」","visibility":null,"source":"第114章"},{"fact_id":"fa